		""
		"&6The Skills it possesses are Cold Nullification, physical attack resistance, Pain Nullification, holy attack resistance, Poison Nullification, Abnormal Condition Resistance and Spiritual Attack Resistance."
	]
	quest.078B1E365E595290.quest_subtitle: "Changes in the sea"
	quest.078B1E365E595290.title: "Crusade Cursed Winged Remains"
	quest.07BCD842AEA4A0C4.title: "Ogre"
	quest.07D69899C52591E9.quest_desc: [
		"It has three phases, advancing to the next phase whenever it loses one-third of its health."
		"&6Its skills are: Flame Attack Nullification, Heat Nullification, Abnormal Condition Nullification, Physical Attack Resistance, and Magic Resistance."
		""
		"After it is defeated, Blazing Frenzied Souls can spawn in Nether Fortresses."
	]
	quest.07D69899C52591E9.quest_subtitle: "Lord of Fire"
	quest.07D69899C52591E9.title: "Defeat the Flame Demon"
	quest.07E64C0B306DB76F.quest_desc: [
		"To evolve into a Demon Lord, you need 10,000 souls. Obtain souls by killing creatures; creatures with higher EP yield more souls. &6Once the requirements are met, a large icon appears on the left side of your personal panel (B). Click it to begin evolving."
		""
		"&lEffects of Evolution&r"
		"Grants &43 times your EP&r"
		"Ally attributes are &bdoubled&r"
		"Some NPC allies evolve"
		"All applicable &5Resistances evolve&r into Nullifications"
		""
		"&6Tip: You can save up a large amount of EP before evolving into a Demon Lord to get more out of the evolution bonus!&r"
		""
		"Before awakening, the player undergoes a 3-minute &6\"Harvest Festival\"&r:"
		""
		"During the first minute, the player cannot use any skills and has restricted vision and movement. All followers in range automatically switch to \"Follow and Protect\"."
		""
		"At the start of the second minute, the player immediately enters \"Sleep Mode\"."
		""
		"During the final minute, the player's followers and monster followers in range also automatically enter \"Sleep Mode\"."
		"Sound and visual effects intensify as the ritual nears its end. During the final 10 seconds, the player begins flashing and slowly rises into the air until the awakening is complete."
	]
	quest.07E64C0B306DB76F.quest_subtitle: "kill!"
	quest.07E64C0B306DB76F.title: "&6【Demon Lord Route】&rConditions for becoming a Demon Lord"
