	quest.0B992C3C64DCBDFD.quest_subtitle: "An ancient tree that increases Aura"
	quest.0B992C3C64DCBDFD.title: "Add more Aura to your surroundings!"
	quest.0BC3C85CABC897FD.quest_desc: [
		"When the player kills a creature, 3% of the creature's own EP will be obtained by the player. If the player has skills such as Predator and Great Sage, he can not only capture more EP, but also obtain the skill of the creature itself."
		"&5As a non-Majin, 2/3 of the EP obtained will be converted into AP (Aura), and the remaining 1/3 will be converted into MP (Magicule)&r. &bAs a Majin, 2/3 of what you get is converted into MP (Magicule), and 1/3 is converted into AP (Aura).&r"
		""
		"It should be easy for you, though, if you choose a race with a high starting value..."
	]
	quest.0BC3C85CABC897FD.quest_subtitle: "How to get EP quickly?"
	quest.0BC3C85CABC897FD.title: "&6【Main Story】&rEP reaches 3000"
