	quest.12E7EFE9B3A1B5A7.quest_desc: [
		"Did you know? Equipment made from leather imbued with Magicule&6(Grade C)&ris no inferior to iron armor, and can even surpass it! The equipment can also be upgraded!"
		"&cGrade C (5kEP) -> Grade B (8kEP) -> Grade A (80,000 EP) -> Special Grade A&r"
		"&8(You cannot check how much EP is still needed for the next upgrade or how much EP you currently have. The EP on the equipment is only used as durability)&r"
	]
