	quest.166F39FFE1C98A63.quest_desc: [
		"&6You must complete the \"Reset Counter\" quest to obtain these points!&r"
		"This allows you to lock any skill. A locked skill is retained even after resetting your character. Unlocking a skill costs Soul Levels and EP. (Unlock it if you no longer want to retain it on your next reset.)"
		"{image:ablazeaqzlcz:textures/ftb/lock.png width:100 height:122 align:center}"
		"The number of lock slots depends on your Soul Grade points."
		"Every 20 points grants one additional lock slot."
		""
