	]
	quest.21B29DCE7B2F00E1.quest_subtitle: "Skeleton Dragon"
	quest.21B29DCE7B2F00E1.title: "Defeat the Ancient Remnant"
	quest.21D64A9C2520E210.quest_desc: [
		"[ { \"text\": \"Click to view the required quest [Ancient Forest]\", \"underlined\": true, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"4835EBAC6D933CDB\" } } ]"
		""
		"&6&lInside the Labyrinth:&r"
		"After entering the labyrinth, you arrive in a large corridor. Follow it upward to the Elemental Colossus arena."
		"Once inside, you must defeat it or be defeated by it."
		"&8&lOutcome - Defeat:&r"
		"-You do not actually die. You are teleported outside the barrier, toward the exit."
		"-You can still form contracts with spirits."
		""
		"&6&lOutcome - Victory:&r"
		"-The Colossus drops a Block of Pure Magisteel when it dies. Throw this block into the center of the arena to revive it."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"After defeating the Colossus or being defeated by it, continue up the stairs that turn right."
		"On the platform, hold Shift to obtain spirits of the following grades:"
		"Prayer has a cooldown of 1,200 seconds (20 minutes)."
		"&b1. Lesser Spirit (Grade 1)&r"
		"-Low magic power."
		"-Grants only the corresponding lesser magic and elemental manipulation (must be learned)."
		"&22. Intermediate Spirit (Grade 2)&r"
		"-Higher magic power than lesser spirits."
		"-Grants the corresponding intermediate elemental magic and elemental manipulation (must be learned)."
		"-Use [Summon Medium Elemental] to materialize your intermediate spirits (switch modes as needed)."
		"&53. Greater Spirit (Grade 3)&r"
		"-One of the strongest spirit types."
		"-Grants all magic of the corresponding element and its elemental manipulation (must be learned)."
		"-Required to awaken as a Hero (collect all 6 types)."
		"-Use [Summon Greater Elemental] to materialize your greater spirits (switch modes as needed)."
		"&44. Spirit King (Grade 4)&r"
		"-Currently the strongest spirit type."
		"-Grants no additional abilities, but is extremely rare and has a very low chance of being obtained."
		""
		"Command:"
		"To check your spirits, cooldowns, and related information, use:"
		"/tensura get spirit"
	]
	quest.21D64A9C2520E210.quest_subtitle: "The Dimension Where Spirits Reside!"
	quest.21D64A9C2520E210.title: "&6【Main Story•Land of Spirits】&rSpirit Labyrinth Portal"
	quest.21E84033328B9661.quest_desc: ["Right-click in the Overworld with over 1 million EP to summon"]
	quest.21E84033328B9661.quest_subtitle: "Summon Reinhard"
	quest.2231192849E57DBE.title: "&#FF6854【Recycle】&fVoid Crystal"
	quest.224308EA704F7F7E.quest_subtitle: "The body is covered with an exoskeleton harder than steel."
	quest.224308EA704F7F7E.title: "The apex predator in the desert"
	quest.225091B4BF12F381.quest_desc: [
		"There are 6 altars inside. Hold right-click on one to turn your view toward a rune block. Break the rune block, then right-click the corresponding altar with it to complete the puzzle. Repeat for the other 5 altars. Once all are completed, the portal in the center will open"
		""
		"The labyrinth is full of puzzles. You must solve them to reach the boss room (the true Azazel)"
		"After entering the boss room, you must have an Azazel Mask to activate the boss (dropped by the church boss in the Nether)"
		""
		"&4&lWarning! If you challenge this boss, beware of all your equipment turning into gold!"
		""
		"&l&#FF4AC3Do not go behind the throne!&r"
	]
