	quest.24A42438DA227224.quest_subtitle: "【Must-see content】"
	quest.24A44C95A35D658D.quest_desc: [
		"Check whether the axe or blade in your hand has EP (Existence Points). This value serves as durability or magical energy. Kill creatures while holding the weapon whose EP you want to raise. Different weapon types have different EP caps, and some evolve upon reaching their cap. For example, a Diamond Sword automatically evolves into a Netherite Sword when its EP reaches the cap. There are exceptions: some weapons never evolve, even at maximum EP, and use EP only as durability or a stat."
		""
		"&6EP regenerates automatically every second, effectively giving the weapon unlimited durability!"
	]
	quest.24A44C95A35D658D.quest_subtitle: "living instrument"
	quest.24A44C95A35D658D.title: "The evolution of weapons"
