	quest.29D96A1CE4910C8B.quest_desc: "&6Dropped by Rimuru, Supermassive Slime, and Lumisdin. &rConsuming it grants 10 minutes of accelerated skill learning. If you have Great Sage, Sage, or Wisdom King · Raphael, it also increases some proficiency. If you have Wisdom King · Raphael, consuming 10 of these lets you lock this Ultimate Skill on the \"Lock\" screen, preventing it from being lost through reincarnation."
	quest.2A243EB62B7E854E.title: "Defeat the Iron Palm of the Nether"
