	quest.3B5B1BFC34011F6C.quest_desc: [
		"        Born between &5nebulae and chaos&r, in a forgotten &bsea of nothingness&r, &4fragments of shattered memories&r and visions of an unfamiliar continent drift through your consciousness..."
		" &8       You do not belong here, yet fate has bound you to this place.&r"
		""
		"&4⌈System⌋"
		"Note: During the first two in-game days, Leech Lizards, Hover Lizards, Barghests, and Direwolves have reduced spawn rates!"
