		"[ { \"text\": \"Lock Skills\", \"underlined\": true, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"166F39FFE1C98A63\" } } ]"
	]
	quest.3DE59F19B491EDC7.quest_subtitle: "Notes"
	quest.3DE59F19B491EDC7.title: "&#A9FFF5【Exchange】&fUnique Skills"
	quest.3EBFD5237BAC875A.quest_subtitle: "Crafting Materials"
	quest.3EDCA6002F1D67BE.quest_desc: [
		"A gloomy biome said to be haunted by the undead, though many medicinal herbs can also be found here."
		"Beware of the Evil Centipedes! These nasty creatures have a paralyzing breath attack!"
		""
		"You need at least 6,000 EP to enter this area."
	]
	quest.3EDCA6002F1D67BE.quest_subtitle: "Another place on the map, another story of your own"
	quest.3EDCA6002F1D67BE.title: "&6【Exploration】&fMiasmic Plains"
	quest.3F92724DDA398BAB.quest_desc: [
		"&6You cannot kill [Stern] directly. During a round when [Crime of Murder] is declared, lure a Judgment Bird into an immobilization trap, then make [Stern] kill it with [Purification Laser]. Each time the boss commits a crime, its health bar drops by 1. &6It dies after 10 such reductions."
		""
		""
		"Its true \"health bar\" represents how many [Crimes] it can still commit. It starts at 10 and drops by 1 whenever you successfully make it commit a crime. After it has committed at least 5 crimes in total, phase two begins."
		""
		"This fight is therefore about setting a trap:"
		"Make the boss break its own rules."
		""
		"[Crime of Murder] is your opportunity to damage it."
		"During this round, killing any entity gives the killer +1 [Crime]."
		"This is the only round in which you can reduce Stern's health bar."
		"You do so by making it kill a Judgment Bird."
		"Focus on the Judgment Bird, lure it toward an immobilization trap, and once it is restrained, wait for or bait Stern's Purification Laser."
	]
	quest.3F92724DDA398BAB.title: "Defeat Stern"
	quest.3F98657DFD336347.quest_desc: [
		"The equipment you have worn since childhood has appeared!"
		"&3Lower level magic steel (18kEP)->&r"
		"&bSuperior Magic Steel (52kEP) ->&r"
		"&5Pure Magic Steel (225kEP)->&r"
		"&dBiological Magic Steel (750kEP)&r-> &4ultimate metal&r"
		""
		"Same as Monster Leather, both can evolve."
	]
	quest.3F98657DFD336347.quest_subtitle: "The Art of Smelting and Forging"
	quest.3F98657DFD336347.title: "&6【Forging Line·Important】&rWrap yourself right!"
	quest.3FA83CA20E40D5F0.title: "{translate:\"task.FF6A7B8C9D0E1235.title\"}"
	quest.3FF9F50B6BD99394.quest_desc: [
		"Reflect damage and poison your enemy"
		"&6&lVenom Guard [Unlock Codex]"
		"{image:ablazeaqzlcz:textures/ftb/curios/thorn_pendant.png width:50 height:80 align:left}"
	]
	quest.3FF9F50B6BD99394.quest_subtitle: "Don’t touch me"
	quest.40AEB58A3D88CA54.quest_desc: [
		"Ability to drink potions faster"
		"&6&lDrink quickly【Unlock the picture book】"
		"{image:ablazeaqzlcz:textures/ftb/curios/plastic_drinking_hat.png width:50 height:80 align:left}"
	]
	quest.40AEB58A3D88CA54.quest_subtitle: "Down It in One Gulp"
	quest.40B67AE14F3BEE69.quest_desc: ["&6Dropped by the Wither with a 20% chance.&r While you have Azathoth, God of the Void, consume 10 of these to enable locking this Ultimate Skill in the “Lock” menu, preventing it from being lost upon reincarnation."]
	quest.40B67AE14F3BEE69.quest_subtitle: "Preserve This Skill"
	quest.413526DA9AF92A22.quest_desc: "Master Infinity Prison, then enter Raphael's Synthesise Mode. Hold Shift + the skill key to switch to [Evolvable] mode, then press the skill key to evolve."
	quest.413526DA9AF92A22.quest_subtitle: "Evolution Requirements"
	quest.413526DA9AF92A22.title: "&6[Advanced]&fUltimate Skill Covenant King · Uriel"
	quest.413CE569DEB67F2F.title: "&#FF6854【Recycle】&fDeadly Poison Crystal"
	quest.413F740EE59BD0A1.quest_subtitle: "Locate the structure"
	quest.41449735E77D4C2C.quest_desc: [
		"Hold a Bottle and Cork and right-click the air to fill it with Bottled Sunlight. The more you collect, the less Aura remains in the area."
		""
		"&6Using it in the Overworld, Nether, and End yields Bottled Sunlight, Bottled Ghosts, and Bottled Darkness, respectively.&r"
	]
	quest.41449735E77D4C2C.quest_subtitle: "A bottle that can hold sunlight?"
	quest.416FB00A97CBD910.quest_desc: [
		"&6Default EP: 2000"
		"&6Equipment cannot evolve"
	]
	quest.4179A079B1184ADA.title: "Zana Horowa"
	quest.4193D1D21332AB0E.quest_desc: ["Drink an Invisibility Potion, then approach the Frost Crystal to steal it. However, stealing it will wake the beast and send it into a frenzy."]
	quest.4193D1D21332AB0E.quest_subtitle: "Quietly does it—no loud attacks!"
	quest.41BD09AC9E50B869.quest_desc: ["Spawns in snowy plains and snowy taigas. Use an Invisibility Potion to steal the Frost Crystal from its hands, or kill it to obtain the crystal. Once its Frost Crystal is stolen, it loses most of its abilities and can no longer use magical attacks."]
	quest.41BD09AC9E50B869.quest_subtitle: "Behemoth of the ice field"
	quest.41E7CFE6CE6A85F1.quest_desc: ["Dropped by Ancient Remnants. Right-click to summon a Modern Remnant, which can be tamed with Sniffer Eggs."]
	quest.41E7CFE6CE6A85F1.quest_subtitle: "The son of Bone Dragon?"
	quest.4205403C9223C4B7.quest_desc: [
		"As shown in the picture, after the player presses the B key to enter the personal Skill panel, he will see some gray Skills (except resistance Skills)."
		"At this time, just click on the Skill you want to use/learn, and then click on the Skill slot in the shortcut bar to store the Skill in the shortcut bar. The operation method is the same as when equipping the Skill to the shortcut bar."
		""
		"After the setting is completed, press the corresponding Skill keys Z, X, and C to \"learn\" the Skill."
		"After Skill learning is completed, the same keys will still be used when releasing the Skill later."
		"Some skills let you switch modes with Alt + the corresponding skill key, and switch forms with Shift + the corresponding skill key."
		"{image:ablazeaqzlcz:textures/ftb/skill.png width:150 height:150 align:center fit:true}"
	]
	quest.4205403C9223C4B7.quest_subtitle: "You won’t know it if you don’t look at it!"
	quest.42D4A8EEE5E25183.quest_desc: [
		"The teleportation stone platform allows players to freely teleport to the place where the teleportation stone is bound. They only need Shift+right-click to bind, and&5Use the magic \"Warp Portal\"&rOpen the interface and select the portal icon."
		"{image:ablazeaqzlcz:textures/ftb/portal.png width:150 height:100 align:center}"
		"If you want to delete the record, just click the exclamation mark and then quickly click the red icon button in the middle twice."
	]
	quest.42D4A8EEE5E25183.quest_subtitle: "What is this?"
	quest.42FCA469EA5C94D7.quest_desc: [
		"&#FFED54Hyperlink:&r"
		"[ { \"text\": \"How Artifacts Work\", \"underlined\": true, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"4DB740093C0BA804\" } } ]"
		""
		"Default Effects"
		"&5Effect 1: Unyielding Stance"
		"Provides +5 Armor. It also provides 25% Knockback Resistance."
		"This effect is active while the artifact is equipped and the effect is unlocked."
		""
		"Refinement Bonuses"
		"Each refinement provides an additional +0.5 Armor."
		"Each refinement also provides an additional +5% Knockback Resistance."
		"Maximum: At +10 refinement, Unyielding Stance provides +10 Armor and 75% Knockback Resistance."
	]
	quest.42FCA469EA5C94D7.title: "&6【Artifact】&fGrade 3 Ancient Artifact"
	quest.434C555DDB10A971.quest_subtitle: "The fortress in a small dome-shaped hill [Choose a route; solo players may challenge all routes]"
	quest.4387D3BF0F0AA32B.title: "Arachne"
	quest.440CA931DFF4AB39.quest_subtitle: "[Click to submit the quest after obtaining the corresponding Spirit]"
	quest.440CA931DFF4AB39.title: "Wind Spirit • Intermediate"
	quest.4454735A12F6DC87.quest_desc: [
		"Found in Japanese-style structures in the Overworld, or spawning in the wild. Master-level Cartographer villagers may offer a map to the structure. After defeat, this Boss respawns once its 40-minute cooldown ends."
		""
		"&8Neutral to all creatures unless attacked&r"
		"This is Rimuru’s form during his battle with the Ogres, possessing the two Unique Skills Predator and Great Sage."
		""
		"&lBOSS stage explanation:&r"
		""
		"&lfirst stage&r"
		"&6-Has a 20% dodge chance of physical attacks, and will teleport to the target when dodging."
		"&6-Can swallow arrows and other projectiles."
		"&6-Skills available: water blade, ice gun, web bullets, breath (random paralysis/poison/black fire)."
		"&6-Restore 5 health points + 20 soul health points per second."
		"&6-Enter the second phase when his HP is below 50% or drops below 1000.&r"
		""
		"&lSecond stage (armored form)&r"
		"&6-When entering this stage, Rimuru will fully restore health and soul health, and clear all negative effects."
		"&6-Equip a full Armorsaurus Scalemail set and Armorsaurus Gauntlet."
		"&6-Summon 4 clones to assist in the battle (the clones have 10% of the main body's EP)."
		"&6-Her passive health regeneration speed is increased to: 15 health points + 60 soul health points per second."
		"&6-In this stage, Rimuru will use all the Skills in the first stage, and additionally cast: Hellfire, Black Lightning, and Coercion."
	]
	quest.4454735A12F6DC87.quest_subtitle: "I want to challenge you"
	quest.4454735A12F6DC87.title: "Are you Rimuru?"
	quest.4488E4793D485C08.quest_subtitle: "huge \"I\""
	quest.4521C5CD54579EBA.quest_desc: ["Reset everything about you back to its initial state!"]
	quest.4521C5CD54579EBA.quest_subtitle: "Applies to “Reset Counter”."
	quest.4547F61DCD2D7B57.quest_desc: [
		"&lWow! What cost-effective \"magic\"—one charged move can carry you through anything!&r"
		""
		""
		"&lHow to obtain:&r"
		"- Mineshafts"
		"- Bastion Remnants (Hoglin Stables)"
		"- Desert Pyramids"
		"- Igloos"
		"- Ruined Portals"
		"- Monster Spawner dungeons"
		"- Strongholds"
		"- Ocean Ruins (large)"
		"- Woodland Mansions"
		"You have a 50% chance to find it in these locations.&l (Official data)&r"
	]
	quest.4547F61DCD2D7B57.quest_subtitle: "Learn various Aura combat skills and become the overlord of the martial arts world?"
	quest.4547F61DCD2D7B57.title: "&6【Side Quest·Core】&rAura technique secrets"
	quest.46222BDACBBA4B70.title: "Zana Horowa"
	quest.465E337F99AEA94E.quest_desc: "Has a chance to be obtained by defeating Hinata"
	quest.465E337F99AEA94E.quest_subtitle: "Requirements"
	quest.46F9C1A11397AF4E.quest_desc: [
		"Use the Spellbinding Table to bind magic you have learned to wands and grimoires. The magic is stored in the weapon, so you can still cast it by equipping that weapon even if you later forget the spell.&6 (Only elemental magic such as Fire, Water, Wind, Earth, Space, Gravity, Lightning, and Sound, plus some summoning magic, can be bound.)"
		""
		"&8You can synthesize one yourself, or you can find it in the wizard tower or the Dwargon in the wild."
	]
	quest.46FF849AF3C24F9E.quest_subtitle: "Complete body, perfect medicine refining material"
	quest.47214EC2867A9B30.quest_desc: [
		"In the Underworld, you may encounter a certain “special” demon."
		"Unlike demons driven only by slaughter, consumption, and conflict, he is remarkably elegant and composed. He does not readily attack the weak, nor does he display his power without purpose. Yet when he truly turns his gaze upon you, you will understand—the being before you is no ordinary demon. His jet-black silhouette, unfathomable magicules, and instinctively terrifying presence all reveal his true identity. He is one of the ancient Primordial Demons."
		"&c“Black”—Diablo.&r"
	]
	quest.47214EC2867A9B30.title: "&fDefeat &6【Diablo】"
	quest.47945DBEFB4C8D26.quest_subtitle: "【Mastery】"
	quest.47945DBEFB4C8D26.title: "&6【Advanced】&fObtain the Unique Skill Infinity Prison"
	quest.47C041D061CC6669.quest_desc: ["After taming TenSura's creatures, you can right-click to equip this saddle to the monster."]
	quest.47C041D061CC6669.quest_subtitle: "Equip It on Your Battle Mount"
	quest.47DEE3D24B6F2A90.quest_subtitle: "Absorb nearby moss and convert it into Aura"
	quest.48345B3536C27D98.quest_desc: [
		"A village built in a Mangrove Swamp, where its inhabitants enjoy the humid environment. You may even find Dragon Essence in their storerooms."
		"{image:ablazeaqzlcz:textures/ftb/lizardmen_village.png width:130 height:75 align:center}"
	]
	quest.48345B3536C27D98.quest_subtitle: "Lizardfolk Habitat"
	quest.48345B3536C27D98.title: "swamp tribe"
	quest.4835EBAC6D933CDB.quest_desc: [
		"[ { \"text\": \"Helpful Tool: Structure Compass\", \"underlined\": true, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"413F740EE59BD0A1\" } } ]"
		""
		"The Ancient Forest is a rare and dangerous biome with a magicule concentration forty times the normal level, only slightly lower than the notorious Labyrinth, where it is sixty times the average. Giant trees, towering mushrooms, and enormous rocks fill the forest. At its heart grows the legendary Labyrinth Tree, currently known to exist only here. Reports confirm more Intermediate Spirits than usual, with a very small chance of encountering powerful, rare Greater Spirits. &2&lHerbalists will also be pleased to find slightly more Hipokute Grass here than elsewhere.&r"
		"{image:ablazeaqzlcz:textures/ftb/ancient_forest.png width:200 height:100 align:center}"
		"&6Please note: Some enormous trees conceal Labyrinth portals high in their branches. These portals are few and well hidden, but lead directly into the depths of the Labyrinth.&r"
		"Not every Ancient Forest has an entrance to the Spirit Labyrinth Dimension. Finding a Labyrinth Tree may take some time. If you spot an unusually tall, distinctive tree in a distant Ancient Forest, congratulations—you have found it!"
	]
	quest.4835EBAC6D933CDB.quest_subtitle: "High danger! Do not enter with less than 8,000 EP!"
	quest.4835EBAC6D933CDB.title: "&6【Main Story•Land of Spirits】&rAncient Forest"
	quest.48653257AF7891C8.quest_desc: "&6You can find this place using coordinates obtained by trading with the Time Warden"
	quest.48653257AF7891C8.quest_subtitle: "Collapse itself"
	quest.4876462A04B3094B.quest_desc: ["&6Dropped by Rimuru, Supermassive Slimes, and Lumisdin. &rConsuming it grants 10 minutes of accelerated skill learning. If you possess Great Sage, Sage, or Wisdom King · Raphael, it also grants some mastery. If you possess Wisdom King · Raphael or Fortune King · Fortuna, consuming 10 allows you to lock this Ultimate Skill in the “Lock” screen, preventing it from being lost upon reincarnation."]
	quest.48849045FD239568.quest_desc: [
		"It can be found in chests in the wild and in magician towers. Of course, you can also choose to synthesize it."
		"&8This item is a material item and is of rare type"
	]
	quest.48849045FD239568.quest_subtitle: "The foundation of magic tools"
	quest.48C18EC1BD11BFFD.quest_desc: [
		"&8Found near Nether Fossils in the Nether."
		"Mine it and soak it in water for about 20 minutes to turn it into a Ghastling. Feed it Snowballs to speed up its growth."
	]
	quest.48C18EC1BD11BFFD.quest_subtitle: "Hatch a Happy Ghast"
	quest.48C51904019DBDE9.title: "Defeat the Flower of the Void"
	quest.48EF9FC96BBC47AC.title: "Ogre Shaman"
	quest.4913736781F06A32.title: "Arachne"
	quest.49250178B975344D.quest_desc: [
		"&6The following monsters can breed when fed! Prepare two adult, tamed monsters of the same species. They must be allied to each other (for example, owned by the same player), not sitting, and off breeding cooldown. Feed each one the appropriate item.&r"
		""
		"&eFeeding injured monsters heals them first. Restore them to full health before feeding them again to start breeding.&r"
		""
		"Any edible item: Armorsaurus, Black Spider, Knight Spider"
		""
		"Any edible item, plus Fermented Spider Eyes, Rabbit’s Feet, Red Mushrooms, or Brown Mushrooms: Giant Ant"
		""
		"Meat or fish: Barghest, Blade Tiger, Fang Wolf, Evil Centipede, Giant Cod, Giant Salmon, Leech Lizard, Sisi, Spearhorn Bull, Tempest Serpent"
		""
		"Fish: Hover Lizard, Land Fish, One-Eyed Owl"
		""
		"Flowers: Army Wasp"
		""
		"Wheat, Hipokute Grass, or Hipokute Flowers: Cattledeer, Pegasus, Unicorn"
		""
		"Meat, fish, Cattledeer Beef, or Cattledeer Steak: Giant Bear, Horned Bear"
		""
		"Beetroot, Apples, Potatoes, or Carrots: Dragon Peacock (requires one male and one female)"
		""
		"Wool: Hell Moth"
		""
		"&eBlack Spiders and Hell Moths reproduce by laying eggs. Black Spiders need a solid block with air above it; a successful pairing does not guarantee an egg. Hell Moths need Leaves or Wool with at least two air blocks above them. Their eggs hatch into Hell Caterpillars.&r"
		""
		"&6Some monsters spawn rarely, so keeping and breeding them is a great choice!&r"
	]
	quest.49250178B975344D.quest_subtitle: "Did you know?"
	quest.4940AF13DC2FACD5.quest_desc: [
		"How to obtain:"
		"【Master】Poison"
		"【Master】Merciless"
		"Consume 700,000 magicules"
		"Subject to the samaelTrulyUnique uniqueness rule"
	]
	quest.4940AF13DC2FACD5.quest_subtitle: "Requirements↓"
	quest.4940AF13DC2FACD5.title: "&6【Advanced】&fUltimate Skill: Samael, Lord of Death Poison"
	quest.497719F98AB65C4E.quest_desc: [
		"He stays beside the Starlight Portal; right-click to speak with him. Bring at least a proper set of equipment if you challenge him—do not go empty-handed!"
		"&6Portal Ruins can generate in any biome. Explore the world and see what you find!&r"
		""
		"{image:ablazeaqzlcz:textures/ftb/eternal_starlight/portal_ruins.png width:170 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.497719F98AB65C4E.quest_subtitle: "Not only a boss but also a businessman?"
	quest.49DBFDBAF97C1BC7.quest_subtitle: "Why only three heads?"
	quest.4A6D37AACDB09FA2.quest_desc: ["As long as you break through 10,000, 99% of the areas you can explore will be unlocked, and you will unlock more powerful Skills to arm yourself."]
	quest.4A6D37AACDB09FA2.title: "&6【Main Story】&rEP reaches 10,000"
	quest.4A98230B150A9D9A.quest_desc: "Build a portal frame similar to a Nether portal, then craft a \"Time Hourglass\" and right-click the portal to activate it and enter the dimension"
	quest.4A98230B150A9D9A.quest_subtitle: "A world frozen for eternity"
	quest.4A98230B150A9D9A.title: "Build the portal frame"
	quest.4AAF730F2A6A96E2.quest_desc: [
		"&6Default EP: 0"
		"&6After reaching 6000, you can evolve into a Low Magisteel Helmet."
	]
	quest.4AAF730F2A6A96E2.quest_subtitle: "Helmet with horns"
	quest.4B0217A8DB07F15F.quest_desc: ["There are many geysers inside that can transform certain items, such as turning a skull into a Wither Skull. Check JEI for details."]
	quest.4B0217A8DB07F15F.quest_subtitle: "How deep is the ocean floor"
	quest.4B0217A8DB07F15F.title: "Go to the Abyss"
	quest.4B75015F91F5714D.quest_desc: ["The prison guard who guards the most vicious criminals, you will be lucky if you meet him"]
	quest.4B75015F91F5714D.quest_subtitle: "Is it the warden?"
	quest.4B75015F91F5714D.title: "prison guard"
	quest.4B7649B9A42AEBEE.quest_desc: [
		"Found in savannas, it attacks players who are not wearing a mask. Wearing a Sunbird Mask makes it neutral toward you and allows you to trade with it for &6Sun’s Blessing."
		""
		"{image:ablazeaqzlcz:textures/ftb/adventure/umvuthi_home.png width:170 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.4B7649B9A42AEBEE.quest_subtitle: "savannah tribes"
	quest.4BA9724587B4D6FE.quest_subtitle: "Materials for synthesizing advanced equipment"
	quest.4BA9724587B4D6FE.title: "Items dropped after defeating Flame Demon"
	quest.4BC9A690FBB9F423.quest_desc: [
		"At the top of the Acropolis tower, right-click the anchor in the center to summon Scylla. Watch out for lightning when you do!"
		"&6She has Corrosion Nullification, Abnormal Condition Nullification, Water Attack Resistance, Physical Attack Resistance, and Pierce Resistance."
		""
		"She has three stages. Each time her blood volume decreases by one-third, she will enter the next stage."
	]
	quest.4BC9A690FBB9F423.quest_subtitle: "woman holding anchor"
	quest.4BC9A690FBB9F423.title: "Defeat the Siren Scylla"
	quest.4C02AA6C31E0ECC6.quest_subtitle: "Floating island in the end"
	quest.4CAB0E1CE150DBD9.quest_desc: "This item drops from killing an Orc Disaster or Orc Lord"
	quest.4CAB0E1CE150DBD9.quest_subtitle: "The treasured item of the Orc race"
	quest.4D001EB712C9BA0D.quest_subtitle: "Before your next attack, think about how to protect yourself"
	quest.4D001EB712C9BA0D.title: "&6【Battlewill】&rBuild a Line of Defense"
	quest.4D396C80A4183219.quest_desc: [
		"&7Long ago, rumors spoke of a mysterious ruin deep within an Ancient City. Meet a special condition to reach an underground world with no sunlight, filled with monsters and rich ore deposits for you to mine."
		""
		"The structure shown below can sometimes be found in Ancient Cities. Look around it for a Portal Catalyst."
		""
		"{image:ablazeaqzlcz:textures/ftb/afterdark.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.4D396C80A4183219.quest_subtitle: "Ruins in ancient cities"
	quest.4D396C80A4183219.title: "Looking for the \"Abyss\""
	quest.4D44AED229765359.quest_desc: ["/foxablazeultimate debug requirements [skill]"]
	quest.4D44AED229765359.quest_subtitle: "How can you check whether you meet all the requirements?"
	quest.4D44AED229765359.title: "A Handy Debug Command"
	quest.4D5E6F7A8B9C0123.title: "Great Poison Taratect"
	quest.4D66FADBC0A3FB2E.quest_desc: [
		"Obtainment: Master Magic Sense + Sense Heat Source + Sense Soundwave"
		""
		"&l[Passive - Toggle]:&r"
		"Combines the effects of Magic Sense, Sense Heat Source, and Sense Soundwave."
	]
	quest.4D66FADBC0A3FB2E.title: "&6【Tips】&rObtain and Master 【Universal Perception】"
	quest.4D886404A58C7D50.quest_desc: [
		"Start by learning any perception skills available to you! Then try defeating some monsters"
		""
		"Born into an unfamiliar world, you cannot see anything. Learn Magic Sense to see the world clearly."
	]
	quest.4D886404A58C7D50.quest_subtitle: "“I can't see”"
	quest.4DB740093C0BA804.quest_desc: [
		"Each artifact has a Grade, an equipment slot, an EP threshold, and one or more effects. Once an artifact reaches the required EP, the effect attached to that EP threshold becomes active. Higher-Grade artifacts are more concise and generally unlock fewer effects. Grade 1 artifacts have the most progression, with up to three effects available to unlock."
		""
		"Artifact Grades and Progression"
		"Artifacts are divided into three Grades. Each Grade determines the artifact's starting EP, effect unlock requirements, and refinement limit."
		"&6Grade 3 Artifacts"
		"- Start at 52,000 EP"
		"- Unlock their effect at 52,000 EP"
		"- Can reach up to 10 refinements"
		""
		"&6Grade 2 Artifacts"
		"- Start at 52,000 EP"
		"- Unlock their first effect at 52,000 EP"
		"- Unlock their second effect at 225,000 EP"
		"- Can reach up to 5 refinements"
		""
		"&6Grade 1 Artifacts"
		"- Start at 225,000 EP"
		"- Unlock their first effect at 225,000 EP"
		"- Unlock their second effect at 1,000,000 EP"
		"- Unlock their third effect at 5,000,000 EP"
		"- Some final effects also require the correct Unique Skill or condition"
		"- Can reach up to 3 refinements"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Artifacts are upgraded in an anvil by combining two identical artifacts."
		"The primary artifact must first be evolved far enough to qualify for the upgrade."
		"&6- Grade 3 artifacts can be upgraded after reaching 52,000 EP"
		"&6- Grade 2 artifacts can be refined after reaching 225,000 EP"
		"&6- Grade 1 artifacts can be refined after reaching 5,000,000 EP"
		"Refinement increases the strength of artifact effects. Under the current system, each refinement upgrade is randomly assigned to one valid effect."
		"Some effects have their own refinement caps. Once an effect reaches its cap, subsequent refinements are assigned to other valid effects."
	]
