	quest.69A16C2D76C41BDE.quest_desc: [
		"It lives in forests, plains, and swamps, so try your luck there. You may also find a Slime King Crown in ruin chests and use it to summon the Slime King!"
		"It is a rare creature with&m&61/1000&r&r(not that low) chance of spawning instead of normal Slime."
		"[\"It is immune to physical ranged weapons and regenerates extremely quickly thanks to &4Ultraspeed Regeneration&r. If you are unprepared, it may wear you down. &6If your skills cannot damage it, visit the \", {\"text\": \"Spirits\", \"underlined\": true, \"clickEvent\": {\"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"4835EBAC6D933CDB\"}}, \" and \\\"borrow\\\" some magic—that is the wiser choice.\"]"
		""
		"&lIts attack method:&r"
		"Deals Corrosive damage (but not the Corrosive effect), so if you have Corrosion Resistance or Corrosion Nullification, you are immune to Slime's damage."
		""
		"After defeating it, the &bSlime Core&r can be absorbed with the Slime race’s intrinsic skill, Absorb & Dissolve, to increase or decrease your size. It can also be used to craft a Staff of Slime and summon Slimes as expendable frontline troops."
	]
	quest.69A16C2D76C41BDE.quest_subtitle: "Don't touch it!"
