	quest.6AAB6D0E51DB699C.quest_desc: [
		"1. Gain EP while affected by Blindness to unlock this skill."
		"2. An easy method is to craft &5Suspicious Stew&r, eat it, and kill a creature to gain EP. This unlocks learning the \"Danger Sense\" skill. Once learned, hold the corresponding skill key to use it for &6Night Vision and creature detection&r."
		"3. Some races have it innately."
		""
		"Once the skill is fully &bmastered&r, you can keep it active in the background by enabling the toggle in the panel to the right of the skill."
