		"Legend carving: 250,000EP required"
		"Ultimate carving: 1,000,000EP required"
		"&6The more EP you accumulate, the higher the rarity of the engravings you can obtain."
		"If you obtain the Blessing of Transcendence enchantment, the equipment will receive 1 random engraving for every 500,000 EP it reaches and each level it reaches."
