	quest.77224F3957EF8057.quest_desc: [
		"There are two ways to reach the Spirit Dimension. Reincarnate as a spirit race and you will respawn there, or travel through the Labyrinth Tree to the Prayer Altar at its deepest point, then fly upward into the Spirit Dimension."
		"Many spirits live here. Some are curious and friendly, while others are hostile. &6This is a great place to obtain Elemental Fragments."
		""
		"&zTo return to the Overworld, jump downward to re-enter the Labyrinth Tree, then use an Overworld portal. The nearest one is beside the stairs leading to the Prayer Altar."
		""
		"&6Spirit races have an extra requirement before returning to the Overworld: use Possession to inhabit a physical creature first. Otherwise, you will soon die after returning to the Overworld! ( •̀ ω •́ )✧"
		""
		"[ { \"text\": \"Complete the Spirit Labyrinth Portal Quest\", \"underlined\": true, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"21D64A9C2520E210\" } } ]"
	]
