	quest.78B7C0A0CB97647C.quest_desc: [
		"A powerful being above ordinary Demons and below Demon Peers."
		"Greater Demons possess enormous magicule reserves and intelligence. They skillfully wield powerful magic and spiritual abilities, placing them among the ruling class of the Underworld. Compared with lower-ranked Demons, they have more stable forms and stronger self-awareness."
